mexperimental-s370
Target Var(s390_s370) Init(0) Save
Experimental audited historical S/370 integer subset; reserves r1.

ms370-profile=
Target RejectNegative Joined Var(s370_profile) Init(0) Save
Select a named Mainframe Lab historical execution profile.
